      "writtenOn": "2023-10-17T07:40:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should avoid using @VisibleForTesting for whenever we can. The @VisibleForTesting is not actually change the accessibility of the method and should be the last resort only when there is no other way to test the logic.\n\nI don\u0027t have strong preference on moving the method to MdnsUtils.java.\n\nBut if the two method is in NsdService.java, we should try to write test in NsdManagerTest.java to test those two methods indirectly without marking them to be @VisibleForTesting.",
